SNAP reference data is the DVC archive `src/testSNAP-omp/refdata.tar.gz`.
It contains `refdata_2J2_W.h`, `refdata_2J4_W.h`, `refdata_2J8_W.h`, and
`refdata_2J14_W.h`.

From the repository root, fetch the archive with:

    dvc pull src/testSNAP-omp/refdata.tar.gz

`make` and CMake extract the headers into `testSNAP-omp` automatically.

